---
title: "What the contractor finder shows"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Map only
    lg1: Results
    lg2: Breaks LatestSearchShows or NeverSwitchesToAnOlderSearch or ResultsStayPut
    lg3: Breaks NeverSwitchesToAnOlderSearch or ResultsStayPut or SpinnerMeansSearching in some cases
    lg4: Path to the LatestSearchShows or NeverSwitchesToAnOlderSearch or ResultsStayPut or SpinnerMeansSearching bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Map only
  s1: Map only, a search is still out
  s2: Results for the latest search
  s3: Results for the latest search, a search is still out
  s4: Results for an older search, a search is still out
  s5: Results for an older search, the visitor started over
  s6: Map only, the latest search never shows
  s7: Results for an older search, the latest search never shows
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP or the visitor taps Use my location
  s1 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP or the visitor taps Use my location or an earlier search's answer comes back
  s1 --> s2: the latest search's answer comes back
  s1 --> s3: the latest search's answer comes back or the visitor searches a ZIP
  s1 --> s4: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s1 --> s0: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s2 --> s3: the visitor searches a ZIP or the visitor taps Use my location
  s2 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP
  s2 --> s4: the visitor taps Use my location
  s2 --> s5: the visitor follows the menu link back to the finder
  s1 --> s5: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s3 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP or an earlier search's answer comes back
  s3 --> s4: the visitor taps Use my location or the visitor follows the menu link back to the finder or an earlier search's answer comes back
  s3 --> s6: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s4 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP or an earlier search's answer comes back
  s4 --> s3: the visitor taps Use my location or the visitor searches a ZIP or the latest search's answer comes back
  s4 --> s7: the latest search's answer comes back or an earlier search's answer comes back
  s3 --> s2: an earlier search's answer comes back or the latest search's answer comes back
  s3 --> s7: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s4 --> s2: the latest search's answer comes back
  s0 --> s3: the visitor searches a ZIP
  s5 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP
  s5 --> s3: the visitor taps Use my location or the visitor searches a ZIP
  s4 --> s5: an earlier search's answer comes back
  s6 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP or the visitor taps Use my location
  s6 --> s3: the visitor searches a ZIP
  s7 --> s3: the visitor searches a ZIP or the visitor taps Use my location
  s7 --> s1: the visitor searches a ZIP
  s7 --> s5: the visitor follows the menu link back to the finder
  s1 --> s7: an earlier search's answer comes back
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
